al  research project that confirmed and the  findings that there was a hole in the  ozone layer and the world came together  to ban the use of CFC  in manufacturing industry which was the  cause of the whole and that's all thanks  to Dobson exactly so scientists still  use his name every time they take  measurements because and the modern  versions of this instrument are called  Dobson meters by scientists and the unit  of measurement for atmospheric ozone in  fact bears his name it's called the  Dobson  you  [Music]
 

